# --- forensic scenario assets: PULLED at ingest, NEVER committed ---
# Disk images, memory dumps and captures come from Digital Corpora at ingest
# time (see README.md) and are large and/or sensitive. This repo is public —
# keep them out of git. A blueprint references the resurrected template by name;
# the bytes are re-pulled/re-imported, not vendored.
#
# Disk images
*.E01
*.e01
*.Ex01
*.aff
*.aff4
*.dd
*.raw
*.img
*.001
*.qcow2
*.vmdk
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.vdi
*.ova
*.ovf
# Memory dumps
*.mem
*.dmp
*.lime
*.core
*.vmem
# Packet captures
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap
# A genuinely-needed SMALL fixture can still be committed explicitly with
# `git add -f path/to/fixture`.
